# QA Evidence Assistant

- Frontend only; no backend or external API calls from the app
- Process HAR files locally in the browser
- Use sanitized sample data only
- Redact Authorization, Cookie, emails, tokens before display
- Separate facts from assumptions; never claim root cause with certainty
- Keep code readable for workshop participants
- Add Vitest tests for pure logic changes
